<title>JAPAN: Plaza Create plans 1.3-for-1 share split.</title>
<headline>Plaza Create plans 1.3-for-1 share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plaza Create Co Ltd said on Wednesday it planned a 1.3-for-1 share split on November 20, for shareholders as of September 30.</p>
</text>
